  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed `StandardInput.BaseStream` equality comparison in `ProcessConfiguration` — was comparing wrapper objects instead of underlying streams\n- Fixed `ArgumentTokenizer` empty-string special case that could cause incorrect tokenization\n- Added null guard to `ArgumentTokenizer` for error resilience\n- Fixed `ShellInformation` file path comparison to use case-insensitive matching, aligning `Equals` and `GetHashCode`\n- Fixed `ProcessConfiguration.EnvironmentVariables` dictionary equality to use `SequenceEqual` instead of reference equality\n- Fixed `ProcessConfiguration.StandardInput` to use reference equality instead of `.Equals`\n\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n\n- Removed `ISuspendableExternalProcess` interface (absorbed into sealed `ExternalProcess`)\n- Cleaned up XML doc comments on `MiddlewareChain`, `InvocationContext`, and `ShellInformation`",
